        "67": "5th"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "title": "Sus2",
      "body": "A **sus2** chord uses a major 2nd in place of the 3rd. Csus2 is C D G.\n\n**Why it matters:** It has a bright, open sound. Swap a major chord for its sus2 and the song instantly sounds more modern.",
